  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dental Goural Livestock and Agriculture Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project leader is a GIE whose framework is made up of 2 women&apos;s cooperatives mainly of young women pastors whose number is 140 women who are wives, daughters and granddaughters of former breeders victims of the deportations of 1989 and who returned to their country of origin in 1997 and 2008 and therefore subject to difficult schooling. This GIE is located in the Wilaya of Brakna and near Aleg, capital of the said Wilaya (Region). It is approved and has an essentially agro-pastoral vocation. It has land potential (4 ha), a few dairy cows and a water tower.</narrative>
  </description>
